        "original_id": "26bde88f-f46d-5da0-b9ff-cfc6e54de599",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Public Television 19, Inc., CBS\n- Stations: KCPT, KTBG, KCTV\n- Places: Kansas City, Missouri, Kansas City, Kansas, Union Hill, Blue Valley, East 31st Street, 23rd Street and Stark Avenue\n- Programs: Check, Please!\n\nFacts:\n- KCPT is owned by Public Television 19, Inc.\n- In 2009, Check, Please! Kansas City began airing on KCPT.\n- KCPT maintains studio facilities on East 31st Street in Kansas City, Missouri's Union Hill section.\n- KCPT shares its studio facilities with sister adult album alternative radio station KTBG (90.9 FM).\n- KCPT's studio facilities are adjacent to the transmitter tower of CBS affiliate KCTV.\n- KCPT's transmitter is located near 23rd Street and Stark Avenue in Kansas City, Missouri's Blue Valley section.\n- KCTV is virtual channel 5 and UHF digital channel 24.\n- KCTV is a CBS-affiliated television station licensed to Kansas City, Missouri.\n- KCTV also serves Kansas City, Kansas.",
